ly from 14% to 26% year-on-year, reflecting strategic business diversification.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"India imports roughly 70 percent of its copper tubes.","quote":"India imports roughly 70% of its copper tubes \u2014 five advantages position Ram Ratna to substitute them","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8031cac2-7f66-4eca-beb5-1644657eb477.pdf"},{"claim":"Copper Tubes & Pipes segment revenue contribution increased to 26% in Q1 FY27 from 14% in Q1 FY26.","quote":"Copper Tubes & Pipes share improved significantly from 14% to 26% reflecting strategic diversification, positioning the portfolio for long-term growth and profitability.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The Vadodara plant is undertaking a phased expansion to double capacity from ~40 towers/month to ~80 towers/month.","quote":"Vadodara, Gujarat \u2014 undertaking a phased capacity expansion, increasing capacity from ~40 towers/month to ~80 towers/month","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=343d3b2e-8dbd-4ebb-ba66-e33153f86d79.pdf"},{"claim":"Expansion for tower internals at Vadodara is planned in two phases.","quote":"Expansion planned in two phases; Phase 1 to deliver 20 towers/month, Phase 2 to add another 20 towers/month upon achieving Phase 1 scale","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bb0271f4-e0b8-489d-b304-9995c740496f.pdf"},{"claim":"A demo small wind turbine is scheduled to be installed at Chikmagalur in Q1.","quote":"Demo small wind turbine to be installed at Chikmagalur in Q1; European tech transfer agreement in progress","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://ww